+ * This is sound because the error only runs one way. A text is a touch, so
+ * omitting texts can push a lead toward at risk and never away from it — the
+ * call-only flags are a superset of the truly quiet leads, and rechecking that
+ * superset gives the same answer a full text pull would, for a few hundred API
